{"id":"morale","lemma":"morale","pos":"noun","rank":2519,"glosses":["ethics, morality"],"ipa":"/mɔ.ʁal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/56/Fr-morale.ogg/Fr-morale.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"morales"},"formAudio":{"morales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Roptat-morales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il n'a aucune valeur morale.","en":"He has no moral values.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},{"g":"value, worth"},null]},{"text":"As-tu compris la morale de cette histoire ?","en":"Did you understand the moral of this story?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to understand","l":"comprendre"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"story"}]},{"text":"Ne me faites pas la morale.","en":"Don't lecture me.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Mon père m'a fait la morale sur la cigarette.","en":"My father lectured me for smoking.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"cigarette"}]},{"text":"J'en ai assez qu'il me fasse toujours la morale.","en":"I'm fed up with him always preaching to me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}